        E. n e. NN0 ( ( a " ( ZZ>= ` ( n + 1 ) ) ) = { 0 } /\ f =
    ( z e. CC |-> sum_ k e. ( 0 ... n ) ( ( a ` k ) x. ( z ^ k ) ) ) ) ) ) $.

    $( Define the degree of a polynomial.  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro,
       22-Jul-2014.) $)
