    vieta1.6 $e |- ( ph -> N e. NN ) $.
    $( The first-order Vieta's formula (see
       ~ http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vieta%27s_formulas ).  If a polynomial of
       degree ` N ` has ` N ` distinct roots, then the sum over these roots can
