     such as this one with ` z = 1 + _i A ` and ` w = 1 - _i A ` which are true
     unconditionally.  This result can also be stated
     as " ` sqrt ( 1 + z ) + sqrt ( 1 - z ) ` is analytic".  (Contributed by
     Mario Carneiro, 3-Apr-2015.) $)
