       the Gamma function itself.  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro,
       16-Jul-2017.) $)
    df-igam $a |- 1/_G = ( x e. CC |->
      if ( x e. ( ZZ \ NN ) , 0 , ( 1 / ( _G ` x ) ) ) ) $.
