      ( vn vm caddc cn cv c2 cexp co cmpt c1 cseq cmul cdiv csn cxp cof cbvmptv
      wceq eqid cneg cpi cmin oveq2 oveq1d oveq2d oveq1 seqeq3 ax-mp basellem9
